*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  TCs and KWs of CB008238 step D
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : jing.tian@nokia.com
...               Test Case Scenario contact  : jing.tian@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation author : jing.tian@nokia.com
